WEBVTT

NOTE Edited transcription of a historical recording. Unclear speech is marked; use current specifications for ordering.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
How to fill a blind-based cabinet?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
First, locate your cabinet.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Simply right-click, click on Attributes,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Click Add-ons, Base Modifications, Box
Modifications, Fill Blind.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Now, instead of the filler, you have a solid
panel to fill your blind.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Select OK and continue with your drawing.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Thank you for watching.
